        "text_axpPt3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We believe that looking great should never come at the cost of our health or the well-being of our furry friends. That's why we prioritize gentle, effective ingredients and use 100% vegan keratin, derived from wheat and soy, to deliver the same benefits as traditional animal-based salon keratin treatments.</p>",
